OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA few
OL,6,Fshowers for the Antrim coast but
OL,7,Fotherwise dry with clear spells. Fresh
OL,8,Fwesterly winds at fist, strong around
OL,9,Fthe coasts, beginning to ease
OL,10,Fovernight. Feeling quite chilly.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSunday:FA dry and bright day with
OL,13,Fplenty of Autumn sunshine and lighter
OL,14,Fwinds than of late. Clouding over in
OL,15,Fthe afternoon with some evening rain
OL,16,Fin the west.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
