OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FWarm
OL,6,Fstart to next week. Variable cloud,
OL,7,Fbright spells and a few showers on
OL,8,FMonday, and Tuesday morning. Rain
OL,9,Flater Tuesday, clearing overnight.
OL,10,FCooler with bright spells, some
OL,11,Fshowers Wednesday.
